nded-2xl border bg-white p-6"><h2 class="font-bold">Communication</h2><p class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Controls parent notices and future email/SMS integration.</p><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><label>Sender name<input wire:model="settings.sender_name" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></label><label>Email/SMS provider<textarea wire:model="settings.email_provider" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></textarea></label><label>Arrears reminder template<textarea wire:model="settings.arrears_email_template" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></textarea></label><label>Notification schedule<input wire:model="settings.notification_schedule" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></label></div></section><section x-show="tab==='security'" class="rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6"><h2 class="font-bold">Security & system</h2><p class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Controls access, retention, backups, and regional formatting.</p><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><label>OTP login<select wire:model="settings.otp_enabled" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"><option value="enabled">Enabled</option><option value="disabled">Disabled</option></select></label><label>Audit retention<input wire:model="settings.audit_retention" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></label><label>Backup/export rule<textarea wire:model="settings.backup_export_rule" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></textarea></label><label>Timezone<input wire:model="settings.timezone" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></label><label>Date format<input wire:model="settings.date_format" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></label><label>Language<input wire:model="settings.language" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border-slate-200"></label></div></section><button class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-yellow-400 px-6 py-3 font-bold">Save all settings</button></form></div>
